    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thats a good start. what if the caterers say they can't guarantee a 100% nut-free kitchen because of cross-contamination risks? how should i phrase that to the law firm clients so they feel safe but i'm not making promises i can't keep?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
